In app.component.ts, add method to handle Save to File button click:
public saveCurrentDiagramToFile() {
  if (!this.currentDiagramFilePath) {
    return  // No file loaded
  }
  const diagramJson = this.searchActions.mapForLlmJson()
  this.ideConnect.output_saveDiagramToFile(diagramJson, this.currentDiagramFilePath)
}

Bind this method to button in app.component.html
Button should appear in IDE topbox menu (section B)
